    "detailed_description": "Light the torches, open the portal and become Grand Saviour of Hapland.<br><br>Hapland is a series of three difficult point-and-click puzzles that were originally released as Flash games in 2005-2006. In each one you have to find a way to open the portal by enlisting the help of the people who live in the world, while not getting them eaten by monsters or blown up by landmines.<br><br><strong>Hapland</strong>, <strong>Hapland 2</strong> and <strong>Hapland 3</strong> have all been remastered in HD with beautiful 60FPS animation. Each game has also been enhanced with extra secrets to discover.<br><br>There's not much in the way of hints, tutorials or hand-holding. If you like figuring things out for yourself, then this might be the game for you.",
